    "overview": "<p>Searching for the <strong>best Pune to Ujjain tour package for family</strong> or a comfortable, guided pilgrimage from Pune? <strong>Shailraj Travels</strong> (Hadapsar, Pune) welcomes you to Maharashtra's highest-rated spiritual pilgrimage covering <strong>Shri Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga (Ujjain)</strong>, <strong>Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga</strong>, <strong>Mamleshwar</strong>, <strong>Maheshwar Ahilya Fort & Ghats</strong>, and <strong>Grishneshwar Jyotirlinga</strong>.</p>\n<p>With over 15 years of operational excellence across Pune and PCMC, our <strong>Pune to Ujjain Tour Package (3 Days / 2 Nights)</strong> is crafted specifically for families with elderly parents and devotional groups seeking a seamless, sacred experience with zero highway fatigue.</p>\n<div class=\"not-prose my-6 p-5 bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl shadow-xs\">\n  <h4 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 mb-2\">⚡ Package Quick Summary (All-Inclusive)</h4>\n  <ul class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-900/90 space-y-1.5 list-disc pl-4\">\n    <li><strong>Package Cost:</strong> Starting from <strong>₹6,999 per person</strong> (Group departure in Luxury AC Force Urbania). Custom private packages in Innova Crysta also available.</li>\n    <li><strong>Duration:</strong> 3 Days / 2 Nights complete Tri-Jyotirlinga circuit.</li>\n    <li><strong>Inclusions:</strong> Round-trip AC transport, 2 nights verified 3-star AC hotel stay (twin/triple sharing), daily vegetarian breakfast, toll taxes, inter-state permits, parking, driver allowances, and temple darshan guidance.</li>\n    <li><strong>Pickup Points across Pune:</strong> Hadapsar, Swargate, Pune Railway Station, Viman Nagar, Bhosari, and Wakad. Doorstep pickup available for private groups.</li>\n  </ul>\n</div>\n<h3>3 Days / 2 Nights Pilgrimage Itinerary:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Day 1 (Pune Departure & Ujjain Arrival):</strong> Early morning 4:30 AM departure from Pune via the smooth 4-lane NH 60 & NH 52 corridor. Hygienic breakfast stop near Nashik. Visit the historic <em>Maheshwar Ahilya Fort & Sacred Narmada Ghats</em> by afternoon. Reach Ujjain by 5:00 PM, check into your 3-star AC hotel, attend the divine evening Deepstambh Aarti at <em>Harsiddhi Mata Shaktipeeth</em>, and explore the grand 900-meter <em>Mahakal Lok Corridor</em>. Overnight stay in Ujjain.</li>\n  <li><strong>Day 2 (Mahakaleshwar Bhasma Aarti & Omkareshwar):</strong> Early morning 4:00 AM Bhasma Aarti / Sheegra Darshan at <em>Shri Mahakaleshwar Jyotirlinga</em> with our token assistance. Post breakfast, seek blessings at <em>Baba Kaal Bhairav Mandir</em>. Drive south to <em>Shri Omkareshwar Jyotirlinga</em> on Mandhata Island; experience the holy Narmada boat parikrama and darshan of Mamleshwar. Overnight stay near Omkareshwar.</li>\n  <li><strong>Day 3 (Grishneshwar & Smooth Return):</strong> Morning prayers, followed by return journey through Maharashtra with darshan at <em>Shri Grishneshwar Jyotirlinga (Ellora)</em>. Arrive back safely in Pune by late evening.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Family & Senior Citizen Comfort Highlights:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>Luxury AC Force Urbania & Innova Crysta:</strong> Ergonomic pushback recliners, individual AC vents, USB chargers, and air-suspension chassis designed to minimize road shock for senior citizens.</li>\n  <li><strong>Mahakaleshwar Bhasma Aarti & VIP Pass Guidance:</strong> Complete advance online booking support and traditional Solah/Saree dress code advice for hassle-free temple entry.</li>\n  <li><strong>Hygienic Pure Veg Dining & Verified 3★ Stays:</strong> Clean, sanitized AC rooms within walking distance of temple gates and verified pure-veg family restaurants along NH 52.</li>\n  <li><strong>Travel Information & Alternative Options:</strong> Looking for scheduled weekend bus options? Check our <a href=\"/pune-to-ujjain-bus-travels\"><strong>Pune to Ujjain Bus Travels</strong></a> departure timings. Prefer self-driving? Read our verified <a href=\"/blog/pune-to-ujjain-road-trip-itinerary\"><strong>Pune to Ujjain Best Route by Car</strong></a> distance and toll guide.</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"not-prose mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\">\n  <a href=\"https://wa.me/919764413556?text=Hi%20Shailraj%20Travels,%20I%20am%20interested%20in%20the%20Pune%20to%20Ujjain%20Tour%20Package%20for%20Family%20(3D/2N).%20Please%20share%20current%20seat%20availability%20and%20pricing.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-xl bg-[#25D366] hover:bg-[#20ba59] text-white font-bold text-sm shadow-md transition-all no-underline\">\n    <span>WhatsApp Booking Enquiry (+91 9764413556)</span>\n  </a>\n</div>",
